  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nMP = Rs. 900\n\nLoss = 20%\n\nDiscount = 36%\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n**1**. SP = MP × (100 - D%)/100\n\n**2**. CP = SP × 100/(100 - L%)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSP = 900 × (100 - 36)/100 = 900 × (64/100)\n\n⇒ SP = 9 × 64 = 576",
